359	\N	\N	2026-10-28 16:42:41.006302	1		{"en_US": "Daily and hourly bookings, double-booking prevention, service folio, check-in/out, room search wizard, and standard customer invoicing"}	m_hotel_booking	Group 12 — Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.0.0	{"en_US": "M-Hotel Booking — Reservations & Front Desk Management"}	53	{"en_US": "\\nM-Hotel Booking (m_hotel_booking):\\n==================================\\n- Flexible Bookings: Overnight stays (Night) and hourly rentals (Hourly booking).\\n- Automated double-booking prevention algorithm across overlapping time windows.\\n- Folio Management: Minibar consumption, food & beverage, laundry, and surcharges.\\n- Check-in & Check-out workflows with real-time room occupancy updates.\\n- Fast Room Search Wizard for front desk receptionists.\\n- Accounting Integration: Standard customer invoice generation (account.move) with payment tracking.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N		\N	Khách Sạn (M-Hotel)/Lễ Tân & Đặt Phòng\nKhách Sạn (M-Hotel)/Lễ Tân & Đặt Phòng/Danh Sách Đặt Phòng\nKhách Sạn (M-Hotel)/Lễ Tân & Đặt Phòng/Tìm Phòng Trống Nhanh		hotel.booking.calendar (calendar)\nhotel.booking.form (form)\nhotel.booking.search (search)\nhotel.booking.tree (list)\nhotel.room.search.wizard.form (form)	official	\N
