<group>\\n                                            <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"field_description\\"/>\\n                                        </group>\\n                                        <group>\\n                                            <field name=\\"ttype\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"help\\"/>\\n                                        </group>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                    <notebook>\\n                                        <page name=\\"base\\" string=\\"Properties\\">\\n                                            <group>\\n                                                <group>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"required\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"readonly\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"store\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"index\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"copied\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"state\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"modules\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                </group>\\n                                                <group>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"translate\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"size\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'reference']\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"relation\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" required=\\"ttype in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"on_delete\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2one'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2one'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"relation_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'one2many'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'one2many'\\" required=\\"ttype == 'one2many'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"relation_table\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"column1\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"column2\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"domain\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                                </group>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                            <group invisible=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"selection_ids\\">\\n                                                    <list editable=\\"bottom\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"sequence\\" widget=\\"handle\\"/>\\n                                                        <field name=\\"value\\"/>\\n                                                        <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                                    </list>\\n                                                </field>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                        <page name=\\"compute\\" string=\\"Compute\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                                            <group>\\n                                                <field name=\\"related\\"/>\\n                                                <field name=\\"depends\\" required=\\"compute not in [False, '']\\"/>\\n                                                <field name=\\"compute\\" widget=\\"code\\" options=\\"{'mode': 'python'}\\"/>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                            <div>\\n                                                <h3>How to define a computed field</h3>\\n                                                <p>Computed fields are defined with the fields\\n                                                <strong>Dependencies</strong> and <strong>Compute</strong>.</p>\\n                                                <p>The field <strong>Dependencies</strong> lists the fields that\\n                                                the current field depends on. It is a comma-separated list of\\n                                                field names, like <code>name, size</code>. You can also refer to\\n                                                fields accessible through other relational fields, for instance\\n                                                <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\\n                                                <p>The field <strong>Compute</strong> is the Python code to\\n                                                compute the value of the field on a set of records. The value of\\n                                                the field must be assigned to each record with a dictionary-like\\n                                                assignment.</p>\\n                                                <pre>\\n    for record in self:\\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\\n</pre>\\n                                                <p>The only predefined variables are</p>\\n                                                <ul>\\n                                                    <li><code>self</code> (the set of records to compute)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>datetime</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>dateutil</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>time</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                                </ul>\\n                                                <p>Other features are accessible through <code>self</code>, like\\n                                                <code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                        <page name=\\"groups\\" string=\\"Access Rights\\">\\n                                            <field name=\\"groups\\"/>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                    </notebook>\\n                                </form>\\n                            </field>\\n                            <button groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" icon=\\"fa-align-justify\\" name=\\"2\\" string=\\"Create a Menu\\" type=\\"action\\" target=\\"new\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Access Rights\\" name=\\"access_rights\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"access_ids\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Access Rights\\" editable=\\"top\\" decoration-warning=\\"not group_id and                                                          (perm_read or perm_write or                                                           perm_create or perm_unlink)\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"group_id\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_read\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_write\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_create\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_unlink\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Record Rules\\" name=\\"record_rules\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"rule_ids\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Record Rules\\" editable=\\"top\\" decoration-info=\\"not groups\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"groups\\" widget=\\"many2many_tags\\" options=\\"{'no_create':True}\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"domain_force\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_read\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_write\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_create\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_unlink\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Notes\\" name=\\"notes\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"info\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Views\\" name=\\"views\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"view_ids\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                    </notebook>\\n                  </sheet>\\n                </form>", "vi_VN": "<form string=\\"Mô tả đối tượng\\" duplicate=\\"0\\">\\n                  <header><!-- used for override --></header>\\n                  <sheet>\\n                    <group>\\n                        <group>\\n                            <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"model\\" readonly=\\"id\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"order\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"abstract\\" readonly=\\"id\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"transient\\" readonly=\\"id\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                        <group>\\n                            <field name=\\"state\\" readonly=\\"1\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"modules\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                        </group>\\n                    </group>\\n                    <notebook>\\n                        <page string=\\"Trường\\" name=\\"fields\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"field_id\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Mô tả Trường\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"field_description\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"ttype\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"required\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"readonly\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"index\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"state\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                                <form string=\\"Mô tả Trường\\">\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <group>\\n                                            <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"field_description\\"/>\\n                                        </group>\\n                                        <group>\\n                                            <field name=\\"ttype\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"help\\"/>\\n                                        </group>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                    <notebook>\\n                                        <page name=\\"base\\" string=\\"Thuộc tính\\">\\n                                            <group>\\n                                                <group>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"required\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"readonly\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"store\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"index\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"copied\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"state\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"modules\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\"/>\\n                                                </group>\\n                                                <group>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"translate\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"size\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['char', 'reference']\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"relation\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" required=\\"ttype in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"on_delete\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2one'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2one'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"relation_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'one2many'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'one2many'\\" required=\\"ttype == 'one2many'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"relation_table\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"column1\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"column2\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"domain\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                                </group>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                            <group invisible=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"selection_ids\\">\\n                                                    <list editable=\\"bottom\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"sequence\\" widget=\\"handle\\"/>\\n                                                        <field name=\\"value\\"/>\\n                                                        <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                                    </list>\\n                                                </field>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                        <page name=\\"compute\\" string=\\"Tính toán\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                                            <group>\\n                                                <field name=\\"related\\"/>\\n                                                <field name=\\"depends\\" required=\\"compute not in [False, '']\\"/>\\n                                                <field name=\\"compute\\" widget=\\"code\\" options=\\"{'mode': 'python'}\\"/>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                            <div>\\n                                                <h3>Cách định nghĩa một trường tính toán</h3>\\n                                                <p>Các trường tính toán được xác định với các trường\\n                                                <strong>Phụ thuộc</strong> và <strong>Tính toán</strong>.</p>\\n                                                <p>Trường <strong>Phụ thuộc</strong> liệt kê các trường mà\\n                                                trường hiện tại đang phụ thuộc vào. Đây là một danh sách các tên trường\\n                                                được phân tách bằng dấu phẩy, như <code>tên và kích thước</code>. Bạn cũng có thể tham khảo\\n                                                các trường có thể truy cập thông qua các trường quan hệ khác, ví dụ như\\n                                                <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\\n                                                <p>Trường <strong>Tính toán</strong> là một mã Python\\n                                                dùng để tính giá trị của trường trong bản ghi. Giá trị của\\n                                                trường phải được gán cho mỗi bản ghi giống phương thức gán\\n                                                từ điển.</p>\\n                                                <pre>\\n    để tự ghi lại:\\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\\n</pre>\\n                                                <p>Các biến được xác định trước là</p>\\n                                                <ul>\\n                                                    <li><code>self</code> (tập hợp các bản ghi dùng để tính toán)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>datetime</code> (phân hệ Python)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>dateutil</code> (phân hệ Python)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>time</code> (phân hệ Python)</li>\\n                                                </ul>\\n                                                <p>Các tính năng khác có thể truy cập được thông qua <code>self</code>, ví dụ\\n                                    <code>self.env</code>, v.v.</p>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                        <page name=\\"groups\\" string=\\"Quyền truy cập\\">\\n                                            <field name=\\"groups\\"/>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                    </notebook>\\n                                </form>\\n                            </field>\\n                            <button groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" icon=\\"fa-align-justify\\" name=\\"2\\" string=\\"Tạo một Menu\\" type=\\"action\\" target=\\"new\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Quyền truy cập\\" name=\\"access_rights\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"access_ids\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Quyền truy cập\\" editable=\\"top\\" decoration-warning=\\"not group_id and                                                          (perm_read or perm_write or                                                           perm_create or perm_unlink)\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"group_id\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_read\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_write\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_create\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_unlink\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Quy tắc truy cập\\" name=\\"record_rules\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"rule_ids\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Quy tắc truy cập\\" editable=\\"top\\" decoration-info=\\"not groups\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"groups\\" widget=\\"many2many_tags\\" options=\\"{'no_create':True}\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"domain_force\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_read\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_write\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_create\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"perm_unlink\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Ghi chú\\" name=\\"notes\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"info\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Lượt xem\\" name=\\"views\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"view_ids\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                    </notebook>\\n                  </sheet>\\n                </form>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<form string="Model Description" duplicate="0">\n                  <header><!-- used for override --></header>\n                  <sheet>\n                    <group>\n                        <group>\n                            <field name="name"/>\n                            <field name="model" readonly="id"/>\n                            <field name="order"/>\n                            <field name="abstract" readonly="id" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                            <field name="transient" readonly="id" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                        </group>\n                        <group>\n                            <field name="state" readonly="1" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                            <field name="modules" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                        </group>\n                    </group>\n                    <notebook>\n                        <page string="Fields" name="fields">\n                            <field name="field_id">\n                                <list string="Fields Description">\n                                    <field name="name"/>\n                                    <field name="field_description"/>\n                                    <field name="ttype"/>\n                                    <field name="required"/>\n                                    <field name="readonly"/>\n                                    <field name="index" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                    <field name="state" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                </list>\n                                <form string="Fields Description">\n                                    <group>\n                                        <group>\n                                            <field name="name"/>\n                                            <field name="field_description"/>\n                                        </group>\n                                        <group>\n                                            <field name="ttype"/>\n                                            <field name="help"/>\n                                        </group>\n                                    </group>\n                                    <notebook>\n                                        <page name="base" string="Properties">\n                                            <group>\n                                                <group>\n                                                    <field name="required"/>\n                                                    <field name="readonly"/>\n                                                    <field name="store" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                    <field name="index" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                    <field name="copied" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                    <field name="state" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                    <field name="modules" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                </group>\n                                                <group>\n                                                    <field name="translate" invisible="ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']" readonly="ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']"/>\n                                                    <field name="size" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype not in ['char', 'reference']" readonly="ttype not in ['char', 'reference']"/>\n                                                    <field name="relation" invisible="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" readonly="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" required="ttype in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']"/>\n                                                    <field name="on_delete" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2one'" readonly="ttype != 'many2one'"/>\n                                                    <field name="relation_field" invisible="ttype != 'one2many'" readonly="ttype != 'one2many'" required="ttype == 'one2many'"/>\n                                                    <field name="relation_table" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                                    <field name="column1" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                                    <field name="column2" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                                    <field name="domain" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" readonly="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']"/>\n                                                </group>\n                                            </group>\n                                            <group invisible="ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']" readonly="ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']">\n                                                <field name="selection_ids">\n                                                    <list editable="bottom">\n                                                        <field name="sequence" widget="handle"/>\n                                                        <field name="value"/>\n                                                        <field name="name"/>\n                                                    </list>\n                                                </field>\n                                            </group>\n                                        </page>\n                                        <page name="compute" string="Compute" groups="base.group_no_one">\n                                            <group>\n                                                <field name="related"/>\n                                                <field name="depends" required="compute not in [False, '']"/>\n                                                <field name="compute" widget="code" options="{'mode': 'python'}"/>\n                                            </group>\n                                            <div>\n                                                <h3>How to define a computed field</h3>\n                                                <p>Computed fields are defined with the fields\n                                                <strong>Dependencies</strong> and <strong>Compute</strong>.</p>\n                                                <p>The field <strong>Dependencies</strong> lists the fields that\n                                                the current field depends on. It is a comma-separated list of\n                                                field names, like <code>name, size</code>. You can also refer to\n                                                fields accessible through other relational fields, for instance\n                                                <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\n                                                <p>The field <strong>Compute</strong> is the Python code to\n                                                compute the value of the field on a set of records. The value of\n                                                the field must be assigned to each record with a dictionary-like\n                                                assignment.</p>\n                                                <pre>\n    for record in self:\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\n</pre>\n                                                <p>The only predefined variables are</p>\n                                                <ul>\n                                                    <li><code>self</code> (the set of records to compute)</li>\n                                                    <li><code>datetime</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                                    <li><code>dateutil</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                                    <li><code>time</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                                </ul>\n                                                <p>Other features are accessible through <code>self</code>, like\n                                                <code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </page>\n                                        <page name="groups" string="Access Rights">\n                                            <field name="groups"/>\n                                        </page>\n                                    </notebook>\n                                </form>\n                            </field>\n                            <button groups="base.group_no_one" icon="fa-align-justify" name="2" string="Create a Menu" ty